<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 | Lost in the Vault</title>
    
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: white;
            margin: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;      /* Vertical Center */
            justify-content: center;   /* Horizontal Center */
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .error-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        .glow-blue {
            position: absolute;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: rgba(35, 131, 226, 0.15);
            filter: blur(120px);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: -1;
        }
        .floating {
            animation: floating 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes floating {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="glow-blue top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>

    <div class="px-6 w-full flex justify-center">
        <div class="error-card rounded-[3rem] p-12 md:p-20 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl text-center">
            
            <div class="text-7xl mb-8 floating inline-block">🔍</div>

            <div class="text-[150px] font-black tracking-tighter leading-none text-white/5 absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 italic select-none">
                404
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10">
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 italic leading-tight">
                    Resource <span class="text-gray-500 font-light not-italic">Not Found</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium mb-12 max-w-sm mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                    The topic or page you are looking for has been moved, archived, or exists in a different dimension of the vault.
                </p>

                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="/dashboard" 
                       class="bg-[#2383e2] text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#1a6fc2] transition-all shadow-lg active:scale-95">
                        Back to Dashboard
                    </a>
                    
                    <a href="/" 
                       class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
                        Home Portal
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/5">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-2">Academic Support</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Not all who wander are lost, but they might need a sitemap."</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>